# gyld-test-app.glade — the minimal app declaration the glade-gyld tests boot
# the node with. Declares exactly the surfaces glade-gyld stands behind, plus the
# workspace share that makes them routable (the loading node mints the
# WorkspaceEntry + ServeClaim, so `(ws-razel, gyld.ops)` routes Local).
#
# This mirrors the `service … gyld.ops` + `workspace ws-razel razel` legs of
# grazel's gyld-app.glade; it is a fixture, not that file.
glade-app v0
app gyld-test

# the verb surface: a directed exchange, answered by the attached provider.
service gyld gyld.ops

# the long-op output surface: appended ops fold + replicate to subscribers.
binding gyld.output log share commons from-cursor

# the ask agent's reply surface, keyed by CONVERSATION rather than by run id.
binding gyld.ask log share commons from-cursor

# the result surfaces a successful build publishes onto (step 4.2).
binding gyld.streams   value share commons latest
binding gyld.stream    value share commons latest
binding gyld.decisions value share commons latest
binding gyld.lens      value share commons latest

# bootstrap grant (data only — enforcement is stage-2).
seed owner gyld gyld.*

# the workspace share this app serves from; the booted loader is its host.
workspace ws-razel razel
